# ─── Runtime data (PII / credentials — NEVER commit) ─────────────────────────
# JSON-file persistence holds parent/student PII (submissions, alumni uploads)
# and admin credential hashes. These are runtime artifacts, not source. The
# app regenerates admins.json on first run via lib/admin/seed.ts.
data/
data/.admin-initial-password.txt
submissions.json
